implementationPlan.description:
Verify once, fresh.
1. The DoD command, `node --test scripts/tests/prompt-cache-launcher.test.mjs scripts/tests/agent-runtime.test.mjs scripts/tests/resume-progress.test.mjs`, must exit 0. Supply its command, exit code and output tail to complete_task.
2. ALSO run, and report each result in the completion summary:
   - `bash scripts/tests/postflight.sh`: the full suite, including the six reconcile-strong-* modes, V07's intent-* modes and every receipt-* mode. Widen MOE_POSTFLIGHT_TIMEOUT_SEC on a busy box.
   - postflight.ps1 under pwsh, and under Windows PowerShell 5.1 through interop from the repo on D: when reachable.
   - `bash scripts/tests/parity-check.sh`.
3. Mutation proof, on scratch copies only (never the shared wrappers). Each mutant must turn its named mode red; restore and rerun green.
   - drop (a): reconcile-strong-unreconciled;
   - finalize despite the kept journal (b): reconcile-strong-receipt-lost;
   - remove the tree comparison in (d): reconcile-strong-rewrite;
   - remove it in (c): a direct unit run of the record block, or note why it is equivalent to (d)'s coverage;
   - keep the rebase retry under strong (e): reconcile-strong-no-rebase;
   - re-enable reuse of the gate result when the base differs: reconcile-strong-target-moved.
4. Report the net diff size. Expect about 250 lines; the QA cap is 400 net.

completionSummary:
CQ-V08, strong (verified-local) profile only; legacy is unchanged. Both wrappers twinned:
(a) a task's unreconciled receipt journal refuses the next completion before freeze/update-ref (MOE_COMMIT_REFUSED_UNRECONCILED_INTENT): no ref move, no rescue, the journal is never overwritten;
(b) a landed finalize is deferred while the journal stays or the proof did not transfer (MOE_FINALIZE_DEFERRED_RECEIPT); the pre-flight replay sends the receipt, then finalizes;
(c) Record block and (d) replay adopt a trailer copy only when its ^{tree} equals the verified tree, else MOE_DELIVERY_PROOF_NOT_TRANSFERRED (journal kept, nothing sent or finalized);
(e) MOE_PUSH_REBASE is ignored under strong.
DoD2: the CAS loop's tree+base re-freeze is pinned by a new arm.
Six reconcile-strong-* arms, byte-identical in postflight.sh/.ps1.
Results:
- full postflight.sh PASS (frozen 85/85);
- postflight.ps1 on PS 5.1 PASS (85/85); pwsh 7 not installed, not run;
- parity-check PASS.
Mutants on /tmp copies, all red on their arms: sh a/b/d/e/f2, (c) via (e) vs (c)+(e), f1 red on V07's same-tree arms; ps1 a/b/d/e.
Net diff 241.
Filed bug task-f6228433 (ps1 File.Replace $null).
Residuals for V09/V12:
- deregister ends the finalizing hold on wrapper exit;
- crash between receipt ack and finalize;
- a different-tree or permanently refused journal needs an operator.
Deviation: step 1 used sed -i on 2 lines (disclosed).
